Reason:  
• Counts each article exactly once via `COUNT(DISTINCT filename)` (avoids double‑counting duplicates).  
• Searches for the word “education” in both `body` and `title`, matching the requirement.  
• Calculates percentage safely with `SAFE_DIVIDE`, and formats the output as requested.  
The other queries either ignore the title field (2result.sql) or may double‑count duplicate rows because they use plain `COUNT(*)` (0result.sql).